sequenceDiagram
  actor Owner
  participant API
  participant DB as SQLite
  Owner->>API: PATCH priority + expectedVersion
  API->>API: Auth + ownership + validation
  API->>DB: UPDATE WHERE owner AND version=expected
  alt One row updated
    DB-->>API: priority and incremented version
    API-->>Owner: 200
  else Stale version
    DB-->>API: zero rows
    API-->>Owner: 409, no lost update
  end
